Ladies and Gentlemen!!!

The *all new* way to get the NH Spoilers!

Folks, I got bored today and wrote a shell script for all of you who need
the spoiler file.  It is this simple:

Step 1: Save this post to a file.

Step 2: Using your text editor of choice, lop off the top and bottom
of this file (at both of the -----cut here-----s).

Step 3: For simplicity's sake, lets say you named the file "doit", then
exit to your shell and type:
% chmod +x doit
^ this is the prompt, so don't type this!!!

Step 4: Then, type:
% sh doit
^ again, don't type this.

Now, get a cup of coffee.
Annnnd, bango!  There is a new directory called "spoilers", and inside, you
will find 3 files:  MANIFEST, README, and spoilers.  Now if that isn't easy
enough, let me know, and I will be more explicit!!!
Rob

